//image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rwSO0JLgTGFXSzNAUOsjDqjvkBX.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Sullen Earth\",\"overview\":\"Uli has key information about the Bloodwolf, but he's jailed by the Mole King. Puss reclaims his role as a hero and sets off on a rescue mission.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yKPRstAk0TqSdIVPw0AbpWxu25j.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Ugly Duckling\",\"overview\":\"Puss swallows his pride and asks his mentor El Guante Blanco for help defending San Lorenzo, but the old maestro’s busy with a surprising new protégé.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GVMhx0isrKqK9HDqSx9Up87cGU.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Muscle\",\"overview\":\"Puss and company seek out the mighty Golem to help save San Lorenzo, but our courageous kitty feels sorely lacking in the brawn department.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pxtkOcgYECralTLZ1m5KO4E52JK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Sword's Man\",\"overview\":\"Puss reluctantly agrees to recruit Goodsword as the final member of his army, but the powerful blade isn't easily convinced.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kUgdpmUH7T7anIN0dIs70GxcAaM.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Escape Goat\",\"overview\":\"With his team finally assembled, Puss realizes he has no idea how to lead them into battle to rescue Uli. But one plucky would-be warrior steps up.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xTa4fx9VNpfxL57zgsk7sry7rqN.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Copy Cat\",\"overview\":\"While he's distracted, Puss agrees to ride for two different groups in the town's horse race. Artephius conjures a Puss \\\"twin\\\" with iffy skills.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/idGufKpl97DWCxh65KHDfCnN92m.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Coin Toss\",\"overview\":\"Puss and others get addicted to a coin toss game, leaving the town vulnerable to thieves. Dulcinea devises a plan to rid the town of gambling fever.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A9orkEOlTeFBEeGWwixKz4sveuu.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"King Pickles\",\"overview\":\"Kid Pickles hates birthdays, so Puss hatches a plan to help him feel like a king on his special day. But the power soon goes to his head.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u6TSkxOv9UGaZvH9DWonRi47o0K.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Pirate Booty\",\"overview\":\"Puss joins a pack of quirky pirates on their quest for some legendary treasure, hoping to nab a mystical crown that could help defeat the Bloodwolf.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z3ASb3oxC2BcMX4HELy1uTJ0x0a.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Cat Fish\",\"overview\":\"When Puss's pirate friends toss him overboard to help him overcome his fear of the ocean, his watery plunge reunites him with a fishy former flame.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mjdJrumQt737HUjO2mrz47DIMQ0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Parrot Booty\",\"overview\":\"Worry weighs on everyone back in San Lorenzo as Puss and the pirates find treasure and must fight a barbaric parrot with a skeleton army.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e0NzMvejJdxTvw7jMFhITOgiqTF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Skeleton Town\",\"overview\":\"Puss brings home the prized Crown of Souls, as well as a pack of creepy skeletons who set the town on edge and make Uli's evil antics seem like a joke.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4pad41gCw8NIicD9DVXYFL7BDFj.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"voteCount\":5,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-15\",\"runtime\":24}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-01-16\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}